STT 890 MLOps HW1

data folder has the sampregdata.csv file. models folder has the two saved models (model 1.pkl and model 2.pkl). The code is in HW1 Problem 1.ipynb. You can load a model with joblib.load("models/model 2.pkl").

Model 1 is the previous model. It uses only x4 because x4 had the best R^2 out of the single X's (R^2 = 0.275). Model 2 is the current model and uses x3 and x4, which was the best pair out of all the 2 X combinations (R^2 = 0.530). So adding x3 almost doubled the R^2 and made the predictions better. Model 1 is still in the commit history (tag v1-model1) and Model 2 is tagged v2-model2.